Product [text box] - ContinuousMixer
Type the name of the intermediate or of the finished Product into the text box. This is the product, which
the ContinuousMixer is to produce by mixing the ingredients.
Remarks
Specify the name of this product in the MaterialsTable.
If the product consists of more than ten ingredients, you can Add Additional Ingredients to the
MaterialsTable.
SimTalk
Product [SimTalk] - ContinuousMixer
Product [text box] - ContinuousMixer
